            "revision_policy": "Current and earlier quarters can be revised with new or revised inputs and seasonal information; preserve raw release times and preliminary/revised symbols. A rebase or changed series definition requires review.",
            "limitations": "Chained-dollar components are not additive. Level is expressed at an annual rate; quarter_change is ordinary, nonannualized quarter-to-quarter percentage change derived from publisher-rounded levels. No currency conversion or vintage archive. Symbol none does not establish finality or absence of revisions.",
            "id": "level",
            "name": "Real gross domestic product at market prices",
            "unit": "millions of chained (2017) dollars",
            "adjustment": "Seasonally adjusted at annual rates",
